From ad59fd2e124dc8590a6f4ebf20c0447fa29673f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] FreeChat: screen protection on iOS

iOS cannot block screenshots. Protected rooms are hidden while the screen is
recorded or mirrored and warn about screenshots, and the whole app is covered
in the app switcher (whose snapshot iOS keeps on disk) even without app lock.
Untested: needs a Mac to build.
---
